# Freeze: Full attachment open preview (click → fullscreen)

Stabilized Aug 2026 (web + EXE + APK). **Ask the human for permission before editing** (see `freeze-attachment-preview-permission.mdc`).

Preserve:

- PDF click → `openPdfBlobAsImagePreview` → `showInAppImagePreview` (**Browser / Width / Height**; default **Height** = one page on screen).
- Multi-page PDF: stitched raster + `pdfOnePageHeightPx`; scroll for page 2+.
- JPEG bytes with PDF label → image preview (not native iframe at 100% with dead ± zoom).
- PDF click uses canonical `https` / `local:` / storage path — not cell-thumb blob.
- Party form and voucher forms: same `FilePreview` → `openAttachmentInApp` path.
- `showInAppPdfPreview` (Fit / Print / Share) only when raster fails; image sniff redirects to image preview.

Do not:

- Make native PDF viewer the default for voucher/party attach click.
- Prefer `::cell-thumb` / `viewPdfThumbnail` blob over canonical ref for PDF open.
- Remove height-fit / one-page logic or break ± zoom in image preview without explicit request.
- Drive-by refactor in `FilePreview` open/click/prewarm paths during unrelated work.

If explicitly requested: minimal diff; test party PDF, voucher PDF, multi-page, JPEG-as-PDF, gallery PDF.
